title: "dune-ruby-moon-turbo"
abstract: >-
  Midnight Atlas: a one-page map of the MidnightDev agent stack, showing which
  repository owns what, where memory is allowed to live, and the one rule every node
  follows: the model drafts; it does not own accept, post, pay, publish, remember or
  promote.
